export const body = "<div class=\"source-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>Photobashing is a technique that involves modifying a real photograph and blending it in a 2D artwork. Concept artists use this technique to speed up the process and increase the realism in their works.</p></td><td><p><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/8492a729656c0640744f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/8492a729656c0640744f.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"717\" style=\"--source-width:289px\" alt=\"Illustration 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><p>In this example, a concept artist uses photobashing to handle the egg-sag situated at the belly of the creature. His reasoning was \"painting all of those eggs could take <em>a while</em>.\"</p>\n<p>First, he finds a suitable picture on the Internet, crop the essential part of it, then overlay it on his artwork.</p>\n<p><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/654b902a548ab0a36fbf.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/654b902a548ab0a36fbf.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"839\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/e66f406fcbfcbd7ae253.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/e66f406fcbfcbd7ae253.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"839\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 3\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/9f12e178c21c518a780e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/9f12e178c21c518a780e.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"837\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>Second, he adjusts the angle then starts to blend it in.</p>\n<p><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/78985c18133ee647bd81.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/78985c18133ee647bd81.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"837\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 5\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/282176cfbdb57129262b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/282176cfbdb57129262b.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"841\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 6\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/e38b1719acd282315878.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/e38b1719acd282315878.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"792\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 7\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p>Rob says it is <strong>very important use license-free images</strong>, so when he browses Google, he always turns on the Creative Commons License filter.</p>\n<p><sub>Note</sub><sub>: You can watch the whole video on Youtube. The title is \"BlizzConline 2021 - Artists at Work: Diablo Hive Mother.\"</sub></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/e2046283aa55744b9c66.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/e2046283aa55744b9c66.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"655\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 8\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p>\n<p><a class=\"source-figure\" href=\"assets/concept-inline/9fe5b895d8625d11ae95.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"assets/concept-inline/9fe5b895d8625d11ae95.webp\" width=\"1150\" height=\"445\" style=\"--source-width:277px\" alt=\"Illustration 9\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></p></td><td><p>Photobashing has helped concept artists keep up with the increasingly rapid pace of modern game production. Although the technique may appear an easy shortcut at a glance, it actually requires a lot of skill.</p>\n<p>If you are interested in this technique, you can find free resources to practice.</p>\n<p>We hope you enjoy this brief introduction of the concept. Happy painting!</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>";
export const images = ["assets/concept-inline/282176cfbdb57129262b.webp", "assets/concept-inline/654b902a548ab0a36fbf.webp", "assets/concept-inline/78985c18133ee647bd81.webp", "assets/concept-inline/8492a729656c0640744f.webp", "assets/concept-inline/9f12e178c21c518a780e.webp", "assets/concept-inline/9fe5b895d8625d11ae95.webp", "assets/concept-inline/e2046283aa55744b9c66.webp", "assets/concept-inline/e38b1719acd282315878.webp", "assets/concept-inline/e66f406fcbfcbd7ae253.webp"];
